    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it’s not just a \"patch.\" it feels permanent. they look at me and they see the future they worked for, but when i look in the mirror i just see someone who wasted all that effort. it’s like i’m holding them back from the peace they deserved because i can't even keep my head above water. i just want the shame to stop. i feel like if i weren't here, the version of the family they're proud of could actually exist without me dragging it down.",
